  bfs: L('Find a way, one step at a time.', 'Breadth-First Search', 'From here to there', 'route', 'Looking for a friend in a park.', 'You ask everyone one step away, then everyone two steps away. Your search spreads out in rings until you find your friend.', 'Check all the nearby places before going farther.', ['Start at the little arrow.','Check the next closest places.','Keep spreading out.','Follow the route to the flag.'], 'Draw a wall across the map, leaving one gap. Where does the search go?', 'When every move costs the same, exploring by distance finds a shortest route.'),
